---
title: Rootlane — incident lifecycle
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Juice Shop
  participant T as Toolbox API
  participant C as ClickHouse
  participant M as AkashML (GLM-5.3)
  participant G as Guild agent (Opus)
  participant K as Senso
  participant R as Replica + Semgrep
  participant D as Dashboard
  participant H as Human approver
  participant F as GitHub fork + Akash
  S->>T: telemetry events (derived fields only)
  T->>C: insert
  loop every ANALYZE_INTERVAL_S
    T->>C: behavioural features for the window
    T->>M: window summary
    M-->>T: ignore / watch / escalate + rationale
    T-->>D: SSE verdict
  end
  T->>G: escalate: start session (incident)
  G->>T: query events (read-only)
  G->>K: policies and past incidents
  G->>T: read source, run Semgrep
  G->>R: reproduce, then verify patch + regression + new rule
  R-->>G: before / after evidence
  T-->>D: SSE steps as they happen
  G->>T: propose fix (only if verified)
  D->>H: evidence, diff, rule
  H->>T: approve (X-Admin-Token)
  T->>F: PR on fork + redeploy Juice Shop
  G->>K: store the lesson
  T-->>D: SSE incident applied
